          "message": "feat: Bump Go to 1.24 (#104)\n\n## Release Notes\n\nGovy now uses latest Go version, `1.24`. Thanks to this shift it also no\nlonger relies on `tools/x/constraints` and `tools/x/maps` packages,\ninstead using native `cmp` and `maps`.",
