          "message": "chore: Update module github.com/nobl9/govy to v0.19.1 (#137)\n\nThis PR contains the following updates:\n\n| Package | Change | Age | Adoption | Passing | Confidence |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| [github.com/nobl9/govy](https://redirect.github.com/nobl9/govy) |\n`v0.19.0` -> `v0.19.1` |\n[![age](https://developer.mend.io/api/mc/badges/age/go/github.com%2fnobl9%2fgovy/v0.19.1?slim=true)](https://docs.renovatebot.com/merge-confidence/)\n|\n[![adoption](https://developer.mend.io/api/mc/badges/adoption/go/github.com%2fnobl9%2fgovy/v0.19.1?slim=true)](https://docs.renovatebot.com/merge-confidence/)\n|\n[![passing](https://developer.mend.io/api/mc/badges/compatibility/go/github.com%2fnobl9%2fgovy/v0.19.0/v0.19.1?slim=true)](https://docs.renovatebot.com/merge-confidence/)\n|\n[![confidence](https://developer.mend.io/api/mc/badges/confidence/go/github.com%2fnobl9%2fgovy/v0.19.0/v0.19.1?slim=true)](https://docs.renovatebot.com/merge-confidence/)\n|\n\n---\n\n### Release Notes\n\n<details>\n<summary>nobl9/govy (github.com/nobl9/govy)</summary>\n\n###\n[`v0.19.1`](https://redirect.github.com/nobl9/govy/releases/tag/v0.19.1)\n\n[Compare\nSource](https://redirect.github.com/nobl9/govy/compare/v0.19.0...v0.19.1)\n\n### What's Changed\n\n#### 🐞 Bug Fixes\n\n- fix: Harden validation interface\n([#&#8203;133](https://redirect.github.com/nobl9/govy/issues/133))\n[@&#8203;nieomylnieja](https://redirect.github.com/nieomylnieja)\n> `govy.PropertyRules.Rules()` and related functions will no longer\naccept a `govy.Validator` instance.\n\n#### 🧰 Maintenance\n\n<details>\n<summary>4 changes</summary>\n\n- chore: Update dependency markdownlint-cli to v0.45.0\n([#&#8203;114](https://redirect.github.com/nobl9/govy/issues/114))\n@&#8203;[renovate\\[bot\\]](https://redirect.github.com/apps/renovate)\n- chore: Update dependency gotools to v0.34.0\n([#&#8203;132](https://redirect.github.com/nobl9/govy/issues/132))\n@&#8203;[renovate\\[bot\\]](https://redirect.github.com/apps/renovate)\n- chore: Update module github.com/nobl9/govy to v0.19.0\n([#&#8203;131](https://redirect.github.com/nobl9/govy/issues/131))\n@&#8203;[renovate\\[bot\\]](https://redirect.github.com/apps/renovate)\n- chore: add extra type info tests\n([#&#8203;130](https://redirect.github.com/nobl9/govy/issues/130))\n[@&#8203;nieomylnieja](https://redirect.github.com/nieomylnieja)\n\n</details>\n\n</details>\n\n---\n\n### Configuration\n\n📅 **Schedule**: Branch creation - At 12:00 AM through 04:59 AM and 10:00\nPM through 11:59 PM, Monday through Friday ( * 0-4,22-23 * * 1-5 ), Only\non Sunday and Saturday ( * * * * 0,6 ) (UTC), Automerge - At any time\n(no schedule defined).\n\n🚦 **Automerge**: Enabled.\n\n♻ **Rebasing**: Whenever PR becomes conflicted, or you tick the\nrebase/retry checkbox.\n\n🔕 **Ignore**: Close this PR and you won't be reminded about this update\nagain.\n\n---\n\n- [ ] <!-- rebase-check -->If you want to rebase/retry this PR, check\nthis box\n\n---\n\nThis PR was generated by [Mend Renovate](https://mend.io/renovate/).\nView the [repository job\nlog](https://developer.mend.io/github/nobl9/govy).\n\n<!--renovate-debug:eyJjcmVhdGVkSW5WZXIiOiI0MC42Mi4xIiwidXBkYXRlZEluVmVyIjoiNDAuNjIuMSIsInRhcmdldEJyYW5jaCI6Im1haW4iLCJsYWJlbHMiOlsiZGVwZW5kZW5jaWVzIiwiZ29sYW5nIiwicmVub3ZhdGUiXX0=-->\n\nCo-authored-by: renovate[bot] <29139614+renovate[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>",
