          "message": "chore: Update Slashgear/action-check-pr-title action to v5 (#158)\n\nComing soon: The Renovate bot (GitHub App) will be renamed to Mend. PRs\nfrom Renovate will soon appear from 'Mend'. Learn more\n[here](https://redirect.github.com/renovatebot/renovate/discussions/37842).\n\nThis PR contains the following updates:\n\n| Package | Type | Update | Change |\n|---|---|---|---|\n|\n[Slashgear/action-check-pr-title](https://redirect.github.com/Slashgear/action-check-pr-title)\n| action | major | `v4.3.0` -> `v5.0.1` |\n\n---\n\n### Release Notes\n\n<details>\n<summary>Slashgear/action-check-pr-title\n(Slashgear/action-check-pr-title)</summary>\n\n###\n[`v5.0.1`](https://redirect.github.com/Slashgear/action-check-pr-title/releases/tag/v5.0.1)\n\n[Compare\nSource](https://redirect.github.com/Slashgear/action-check-pr-title/compare/v5.0.0...v5.0.1)\n\n**Full Changelog**:\n<https://github.com/Slashgear/action-check-pr-title/compare/v5.0.0...v5.0.1>\n\n- Readme update\n\n###\n[`v5.0.0`](https://redirect.github.com/Slashgear/action-check-pr-title/releases/tag/v5.0.0)\n\n[Compare\nSource](https://redirect.github.com/Slashgear/action-check-pr-title/compare/v4.3.0...v5.0.0)\n\n#### What's Changed\n\n- chore(upgrade): upgrade test stack to use vitest and oxlint by\n[@&#8203;Slashgear](https://redirect.github.com/Slashgear) in\n[#&#8203;175](https://redirect.github.com/Slashgear/action-check-pr-title/pull/175)\n- chore: cleanup and add lint by\n[@&#8203;Slashgear](https://redirect.github.com/Slashgear) in\n[#&#8203;179](https://redirect.github.com/Slashgear/action-check-pr-title/pull/179)\n- chore: update actions/github by\n[@&#8203;Slashgear](https://redirect.github.com/Slashgear) in\n[#&#8203;180](https://redirect.github.com/Slashgear/action-check-pr-title/pull/180)\n- feat: upgrade node runner to 20 by\n[@&#8203;Slashgear](https://redirect.github.com/Slashgear) in\n[#&#8203;181](https://redirect.github.com/Slashgear/action-check-pr-title/pull/181)\n\n**BREAKING CHANGE**\n\n- Drop support of Node < 20\n\n**Full Changelog**:\n<https://github.com/Slashgear/action-check-pr-title/compare/v4.3.0...v5.0.0>\n\n</details>\n\n---\n\n### Configuration\n\n📅 **Schedule**: Branch creation - At 12:00 AM through 04:59 AM and 10:00\nPM through 11:59 PM, Monday through Friday ( * 0-4,22-23 * * 1-5 ), Only\non Sunday and Saturday ( * * * * 0,6 ) (UTC), Automerge - At any time\n(no schedule defined).\n\n🚦 **Automerge**: Disabled by config. Please merge this manually once you\nare satisfied.\n\n♻ **Rebasing**: Whenever PR becomes conflicted, or you tick the\nrebase/retry checkbox.\n\n🔕 **Ignore**: Close this PR and you won't be reminded about this update\nagain.\n\n---\n\n- [ ] <!-- rebase-check -->If you want to rebase/retry this PR, check\nthis box\n\n---\n\nThis PR was generated by [Mend Renovate](https://mend.io/renovate/).\nView the [repository job\nlog](https://developer.mend.io/github/nobl9/govy).\n\n<!--renovate-debug:eyJjcmVhdGVkSW5WZXIiOiI0MS45MS4xIiwidXBkYXRlZEluVmVyIjoiNDEuOTcuMTAiLCJ0YXJnZXRCcmFuY2giOiJtYWluIiwibGFiZWxzIjpbImRlcGVuZGVuY2llcyIsImdpdGh1Yi1hY3Rpb25zIiwicmVub3ZhdGUiXX0=-->\n\nCo-authored-by: renovate[bot] <29139614+renovate[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>",
