          "message": "chore: Update dependency cspell to v9.2.1 (#156)\n\nComing soon: The Renovate bot (GitHub App) will be renamed to Mend. PRs\nfrom Renovate will soon appear from 'Mend'. Learn more\n[here](https://redirect.github.com/renovatebot/renovate/discussions/37842).\n\nThis PR contains the following updates:\n\n| Package | Change | Age | Adoption | Passing | Confidence |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| [cspell](https://cspell.org/)\n([source](https://redirect.github.com/streetsidesoftware/cspell/tree/HEAD/packages/cspell))\n| [`9.2.0` ->\n`9.2.1`](https://renovatebot.com/diffs/npm/cspell/9.2.0/9.2.1) |\n[![age](https://developer.mend.io/api/mc/badges/age/npm/cspell/9.2.1?slim=true)](https://docs.renovatebot.com/merge-confidence/)\n|\n[![adoption](https://developer.mend.io/api/mc/badges/adoption/npm/cspell/9.2.1?slim=true)](https://docs.renovatebot.com/merge-confidence/)\n|\n[![passing](https://developer.mend.io/api/mc/badges/compatibility/npm/cspell/9.2.0/9.2.1?slim=true)](https://docs.renovatebot.com/merge-confidence/)\n|\n[![confidence](https://developer.mend.io/api/mc/badges/confidence/npm/cspell/9.2.0/9.2.1?slim=true)](https://docs.renovatebot.com/merge-confidence/)\n|\n\n---\n\n### Release Notes\n\n<details>\n<summary>streetsidesoftware/cspell (cspell)</summary>\n\n###\n[`v9.2.1`](https://redirect.github.com/streetsidesoftware/cspell/blob/HEAD/packages/cspell/CHANGELOG.md#v921-2025-08-31)\n\n[Compare\nSource](https://redirect.github.com/streetsidesoftware/cspell/compare/v9.2.0...v9.2.1)\n\n##### Dictionary Updates\n\n<details>\n<summary>fix: Workflow Bot -- Update Dictionaries (main) (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/streetsidesoftware/cspell/pull/7795\">#&#8203;7795</a>)</summary>\n\n##### fix: Workflow Bot -- Update Dictionaries (main)\n([#&#8203;7795](https://redirect.github.com/streetsidesoftware/cspell/pull/7795))\n\n</details>\n\n---\n\n### Configuration\n\n📅 **Schedule**: Branch creation - At 12:00 AM through 04:59 AM and 10:00\nPM through 11:59 PM, Monday through Friday ( * 0-4,22-23 * * 1-5 ), Only\non Sunday and Saturday ( * * * * 0,6 ) (UTC), Automerge - At any time\n(no schedule defined).\n\n🚦 **Automerge**: Enabled.\n\n♻ **Rebasing**: Whenever PR becomes conflicted, or you tick the\nrebase/retry checkbox.\n\n🔕 **Ignore**: Close this PR and you won't be reminded about this update\nagain.\n\n---\n\n- [ ] <!-- rebase-check -->If you want to rebase/retry this PR, check\nthis box\n\n---\n\nThis PR was generated by [Mend Renovate](https://mend.io/renovate/).\nView the [repository job\nlog](https://developer.mend.io/github/nobl9/govy).\n\n<!--renovate-debug:eyJjcmVhdGVkSW5WZXIiOiI0MS45MS4xIiwidXBkYXRlZEluVmVyIjoiNDEuOTcuMTAiLCJ0YXJnZXRCcmFuY2giOiJtYWluIiwibGFiZWxzIjpbImRlcGVuZGVuY2llcyIsImphdmFzY3JpcHQiLCJyZW5vdmF0ZSJdfQ==-->\n\nCo-authored-by: renovate[bot] <29139614+renovate[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>",
