          "message": "feat: introduce govy.Plan validation (#165)\n\n## Motivation\n\nSee https://github.com/nobl9/govy/issues/126.\n\n## Summary\n\nIn addition to the introduced plan validation changes, I've aligned the\n`govy.Predicate` options to follow printf-like functions best practices.\n\n## Release Notes\n\n`govy.Plan` now returns an error if its validation fails.\nCurrently only one validation option is provided:\n`govy.PlanRequirePredicateDescription`, which checks if all `When`\npredicates have description.\nThis and all other future validation options are bundled into\n`govy.PlanStrictMode` option.\n\n## Breaking Changes\n\n`govy.Plan` now returns an error if its validation fails.\n`govy.WhenDescription` no longer accepts additional arguments, only a\nsingle string now. To use printf-like formatting use the newly added\n`govy.WhenDescriptionf`.\n`govy.WhenOptions` has been rename to `govy.WhenOption`.",
          "timestamp": "2025-10-29T09:48:52+01:00",
          "tree_id": "ff53069b5fcee35341af109222f9316ef31dc05b",
          "url": "https://github.com/nobl9/govy/commit/c78fcd2238bfaf3b82dadf76673ac206b88c8aa2"
