          "id": "06b898eb4debc166bd9d5b9d3442487e2b95a863",
          "message": "chore: extend golangci-lint to include additional directories (#168)\n\nSince `golangci-lint run` and `golangci-lint fmt` work in a slightly\ndifferent fashion, where `run` works on a module and `fmt` on plain\nfiles, we need to explicitly add nested modules to `run` invocation.\n\nSee https://github.com/golangci/golangci-lint/issues/6170 for more\ndetails.",
