          "distinct": true,
          "id": "1ef23367dfc28e0e3540ed1ef80e5b1bc78b83cb",
          "message": "chore: Update dependency gosec to v2.22.10 (#170)\n\nThis PR contains the following updates:\n\n| Package | Update | Change |\n|---|---|---|\n| [gosec](https://redirect.github.com/securego/gosec) | patch | `2.22.9`\n-> `2.22.10` |\n\n---\n\n### Release Notes\n\n<details>\n<summary>securego/gosec (gosec)</summary>\n\n###\n[`v2.22.10`](https://redirect.github.com/securego/gosec/releases/tag/v2.22.10)\n\n#### Changelog\n\n-\n[`6be2b51`](https://redirect.github.com/securego/gosec/commit/6be2b51fd78feca86af91f5186b7964d76cb1256)\nUpdate go to version 1.25.3 and 1.24.9 in CI\n([#&#8203;1404](https://redirect.github.com/securego/gosec/issues/1404))\n-\n[`fddb942`](https://redirect.github.com/securego/gosec/commit/fddb9427b874cb5177d0b52a31b293deeb83c1b4)\nchore(deps): update all dependencies\n([#&#8203;1402](https://redirect.github.com/securego/gosec/issues/1402))\n-\n[`f676031`](https://redirect.github.com/securego/gosec/commit/f6760311e8a3db06e3d2d7e9817874dadcd34a25)\nUpdate go to version 1.25.2 and 2.24.8 in CI\n([#&#8203;1401](https://redirect.github.com/securego/gosec/issues/1401))\n-\n[`35f7ec2`](https://redirect.github.com/securego/gosec/commit/35f7ec2ca2e35fb91f7684b376a58e0c61f6c2a3)\nchore(deps): update all dependencies\n([#&#8203;1399](https://redirect.github.com/securego/gosec/issues/1399))\n-\n[`01029f0`](https://redirect.github.com/securego/gosec/commit/01029f0a74161c70f029d51b61592418038aa4b9)\ncheck nil slices, partially check bounds\n([#&#8203;1396](https://redirect.github.com/securego/gosec/issues/1396))\n-\n[`34db3de`](https://redirect.github.com/securego/gosec/commit/34db3de0ee2c7ee2db87ce232132db29775ca50c)\nRemove unused target from the makefile\n-\n[`f5a3b7a`](https://redirect.github.com/securego/gosec/commit/f5a3b7ab78e0d83f3d73c30c6a029f74bf1825db)\nUse the ginkgo command install by the dependencies\n-\n[`761fcbc`](https://redirect.github.com/securego/gosec/commit/761fcbc36cc182a6abd8b668000120c8b642203f)\nKeep the go module at 1.24 version for compatibility reasons\n-\n[`2238079`](https://redirect.github.com/securego/gosec/commit/2238079261fdbec5c6d2eeabdd35506bd2e02707)\nRemove manual test deps\n-\n[`bb08aa3`](https://redirect.github.com/securego/gosec/commit/bb08aa3188034402763918bf82511b2c3b70e928)\nfix: text must be supplied when markdown is used\n-\n[`23597d2`](https://redirect.github.com/securego/gosec/commit/23597d2569a26d726aa56a59460286afeddcc284)\nfix: improve error message of CheckAnalyzers\n-\n[`8d7e9d5`](https://redirect.github.com/securego/gosec/commit/8d7e9d598b887054bde0a84b08680d165bf90068)\nfix: log panic on SSA\n-\n[`0d8255e`](https://redirect.github.com/securego/gosec/commit/0d8255e75e4957f2469bf048a461484854419eab)\nchore(deps): update all dependencies\n-\n[`f9c52aa`](https://redirect.github.com/securego/gosec/commit/f9c52aac4b897c84070cb8c8ef0c0d2d2180d532)\nUpdate gosec to version v.22.9 in the github action\n\n</details>\n\n---\n\n### Configuration\n\n📅 **Schedule**: Branch creation - At 12:00 AM through 04:59 AM and 10:00\nPM through 11:59 PM, Monday through Friday ( * 0-4,22-23 * * 1-5 ), Only\non Sunday and Saturday ( * * * * 0,6 ) (UTC), Automerge - At any time\n(no schedule defined).\n\n🚦 **Automerge**: Enabled.\n\n♻ **Rebasing**: Whenever PR becomes conflicted, or you tick the\nrebase/retry checkbox.\n\n🔕 **Ignore**: Close this PR and you won't be reminded about this update\nagain.\n\n---\n\n- [ ] <!-- rebase-check -->If you want to rebase/retry this PR, check\nthis box\n\n---\n\nThis PR was generated by [Mend Renovate](https://mend.io/renovate/).\nView the [repository job\nlog](https://developer.mend.io/github/nobl9/govy).\n\n<!--renovate-debug:eyJjcmVhdGVkSW5WZXIiOiI0MS4xNTkuNCIsInVwZGF0ZWRJblZlciI6IjQxLjE1OS40IiwidGFyZ2V0QnJhbmNoIjoibWFpbiIsImxhYmVscyI6WyJkZXBlbmRlbmNpZXMiLCJyZW5vdmF0ZSJdfQ==-->\n\nCo-authored-by: renovate[bot] <29139614+renovate[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>",
