          "message": "feat: export interface definitions  (#176)\n\n## Motivation\n\nIt is currently impossible to do something like this:\n\n```go\n\tvar properties []govy.propertyRulesInterface[Spec]\n\t...\n\treturn govy.New[Spec](\n\t\tproperties...\n\t)\n```\n\nIn order to support this code pattern we need to export several\ninterfaces.",
