          "id": "dc2ebf5bad639ad743c85dd1aae30d06f6931bf3",
          "message": "chore: add test commit title to release drafter config (#197)\n\n## Summary\n- Add support for `test:` prefix in release-drafter.yml autolabeler\n- Add `test` label to Maintenance category\n\nThis matches the allowed prefixes in pr-title.yml workflow and ensures\ntest-related PRs are properly labeled and appear in release notes.\n\nRelated to nobl9/nobl9-go#882",
