          "distinct": true,
          "id": "e0d3a7c720e99450ce77d8b00e666b2a9a9bc67b",
          "message": "feat: add property comparison rules for ordered and comparable types (#203)\n\n## Motivation\n\nGovy lacks rules for comparing two property values. Users need to write\ncustom rules to validate relationships between properties, such as\nensuring `endTime` is after `startTime` or that one numeric property is\ngreater than another.\n\n## Summary\n\nAdded eight new property comparison rules for validating relationships\nbetween two properties:\n\n- `GTProperties` / `GTEProperties` - first property must be greater than\n(or equal to) second property\n- `LTProperties` / `LTEProperties` - first property must be less than\n(or equal to) second property\n- `GTComparableProperties` / `GTEComparableProperties` - greater than\ncomparisons for types with `Compare` method\n- `LTComparableProperties` / `LTEComparableProperties` - less than\ncomparisons for types with `Compare` method\n\nEach rule has two variants:\n- `*Properties` for `cmp.Ordered` types (int, float64, string, etc.)\n- `*ComparableProperties` for types implementing the `Comparable`\ninterface (e.g., `time.Time`)\n\nAll rules include error codes, message templates, comprehensive tests,\nand usage examples.\n\n## Related Changes\n\nNone\n\n## Testing\n\n- Added comprehensive unit tests in `pkg/rules/comparable_test.go`\ncovering all eight property comparison rules\n- Added example test demonstrating time range validation (`startTime`\nbefore `endTime`)\n- All tests pass successfully\n\n## Release Notes\n\nAdded property comparison validation rules: `GTProperties`,\n`GTEProperties`, `LTProperties`, `LTEProperties` for ordered types, and\n`GTComparableProperties`, `GTEComparableProperties`,\n`LTComparableProperties`, `LTEComparableProperties` for types with\nCompare methods. These rules enable validating relationships between two\nproperties (e.g., ensuring a start time is before an end time).",
          "timestamp": "2026-03-11T13:37:01+01:00",
          "tree_id": "cea5a484f68d2dcafdb1534798d68d766ff74bf3",
          "url": "https://github.com/nobl9/govy/commit/e0d3a7c720e99450ce77d8b00e666b2a9a9bc67b"
