          "message": "chore: Update module github.com/nobl9/govy to v0.24.0 (#204)\n\nThis PR contains the following updates:\n\n| Package | Change |\n[Age](https://docs.renovatebot.com/merge-confidence/) |\n[Adoption](https://docs.renovatebot.com/merge-confidence/) |\n[Passing](https://docs.renovatebot.com/merge-confidence/) |\n[Confidence](https://docs.renovatebot.com/merge-confidence/) |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| [github.com/nobl9/govy](https://redirect.github.com/nobl9/govy) |\n`v0.23.0` → `v0.24.0` |\n![age](https://developer.mend.io/api/mc/badges/age/go/github.com%2fnobl9%2fgovy/v0.24.0?slim=true)\n|\n![adoption](https://developer.mend.io/api/mc/badges/adoption/go/github.com%2fnobl9%2fgovy/v0.24.0?slim=true)\n|\n![passing](https://developer.mend.io/api/mc/badges/compatibility/go/github.com%2fnobl9%2fgovy/v0.23.0/v0.24.0?slim=true)\n|\n![confidence](https://developer.mend.io/api/mc/badges/confidence/go/github.com%2fnobl9%2fgovy/v0.23.0/v0.24.0?slim=true)\n|\n\n---\n\n### Release Notes\n\n<details>\n<summary>nobl9/govy (github.com/nobl9/govy)</summary>\n\n###\n[`v0.24.0`](https://redirect.github.com/nobl9/govy/releases/tag/v0.24.0)\n\n[Compare\nSource](https://redirect.github.com/nobl9/govy/compare/v0.23.0...v0.24.0)\n\n### What's Changed\n\n#### 🚀 Features\n\n- feat: add property comparison rules for ordered and comparable types\n([#&#8203;203](https://redirect.github.com/nobl9/govy/issues/203))\n[@&#8203;nieomylnieja](https://redirect.github.com/nieomylnieja)\n> Added property comparison validation rules: `GTProperties`,\n`GTEProperties`, `LTProperties`, `LTEProperties` for ordered types, and\n`GTComparableProperties`, `GTEComparableProperties`,\n`LTComparableProperties`, `LTEComparableProperties` for types with\nCompare methods. These rules enable validating relationships between two\nproperties (e.g., ensuring a start time is before an end time).\n\n#### 🧰 Maintenance\n\n<details>\n<summary>12 changes</summary>\n\n- chore: Update dependency markdownlint-cli to v0.48.0\n([#&#8203;201](https://redirect.github.com/nobl9/govy/issues/201))\n@&#8203;[renovate\\[bot\\]](https://redirect.github.com/apps/renovate)\n- chore: Update dependency cspell to v9.7.0\n([#&#8203;200](https://redirect.github.com/nobl9/govy/issues/200))\n@&#8203;[renovate\\[bot\\]](https://redirect.github.com/apps/renovate)\n- chore: Update module github.com/nobl9/govy to v0.23.0\n([#&#8203;186](https://redirect.github.com/nobl9/govy/issues/186))\n@&#8203;[renovate\\[bot\\]](https://redirect.github.com/apps/renovate)\n- infra: configure breaking change and add missing titles to patch\n([#&#8203;199](https://redirect.github.com/nobl9/govy/issues/199))\n[@&#8203;nieomylnieja](https://redirect.github.com/nieomylnieja)\n- chore: remove gosec dependency from devbox\n([#&#8203;198](https://redirect.github.com/nobl9/govy/issues/198))\n[@&#8203;nieomylnieja](https://redirect.github.com/nieomylnieja)\n- chore: Update dependency golangci-lint to v2.10.1\n([#&#8203;196](https://redirect.github.com/nobl9/govy/issues/196))\n@&#8203;[renovate\\[bot\\]](https://redirect.github.com/apps/renovate)\n- chore: add test commit title to release drafter config\n([#&#8203;197](https://redirect.github.com/nobl9/govy/issues/197))\n[@&#8203;nieomylnieja](https://redirect.github.com/nieomylnieja)\n- chore: add Context7 configuration file\n([#&#8203;195](https://redirect.github.com/nobl9/govy/issues/195))\n[@&#8203;nieomylnieja](https://redirect.github.com/nieomylnieja)\n- chore: Update goreleaser/goreleaser-action action to v7\n([#&#8203;194](https://redirect.github.com/nobl9/govy/issues/194))\n@&#8203;[renovate\\[bot\\]](https://redirect.github.com/apps/renovate)\n- chore: Update dependency golangci-lint to v2.9.0\n([#&#8203;192](https://redirect.github.com/nobl9/govy/issues/192))\n@&#8203;[renovate\\[bot\\]](https://redirect.github.com/apps/renovate)\n- chore: Update dependency go to v1.26.0\n([#&#8203;191](https://redirect.github.com/nobl9/govy/issues/191))\n@&#8203;[renovate\\[bot\\]](https://redirect.github.com/apps/renovate)\n- chore: Update dependency cspell to v9.6.4\n([#&#8203;190](https://redirect.github.com/nobl9/govy/issues/190))\n@&#8203;[renovate\\[bot\\]](https://redirect.github.com/apps/renovate)\n\n</details>\n\n</details>\n\n---\n\n### Configuration\n\n📅 **Schedule**: Branch creation - At 12:00 AM through 04:59 AM and 10:00\nPM through 11:59 PM, Monday through Friday ( * 0-4,22-23 * * 1-5 ), Only\non Sunday and Saturday ( * * * * 0,6 ) (UTC), Automerge - At any time\n(no schedule defined).\n\n🚦 **Automerge**: Enabled.\n\n♻ **Rebasing**: Whenever PR becomes conflicted, or you tick the\nrebase/retry checkbox.\n\n🔕 **Ignore**: Close this PR and you won't be reminded about this update\nagain.\n\n---\n\n- [ ] <!-- rebase-check -->If you want to rebase/retry this PR, check\nthis box\n\n---\n\nThis PR was generated by [Mend Renovate](https://mend.io/renovate/).\nView the [repository job\nlog](https://developer.mend.io/github/nobl9/govy).\n\n<!--renovate-debug:eyJjcmVhdGVkSW5WZXIiOiI0My41OS4wIiwidXBkYXRlZEluVmVyIjoiNDMuNTkuMCIsInRhcmdldEJyYW5jaCI6Im1haW4iLCJsYWJlbHMiOlsiZGVwZW5kZW5jaWVzIiwiZ29sYW5nIiwicmVub3ZhdGUiXX0=-->\n\nCo-authored-by: renovate[bot] <29139614+renovate[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>",
