          "message": "chore: Update jetpack-io/devbox-install-action action to v0.15.0 (#209)\n\nThis PR contains the following updates:\n\n| Package | Type | Update | Change |\n|---|---|---|---|\n|\n[jetpack-io/devbox-install-action](https://redirect.github.com/jetpack-io/devbox-install-action)\n| action | minor | `v0.14.0` → `v0.15.0` |\n\n---\n\n### Release Notes\n\n<details>\n<summary>jetpack-io/devbox-install-action\n(jetpack-io/devbox-install-action)</summary>\n\n###\n[`v0.15.0`](https://redirect.github.com/jetify-com/devbox-install-action/releases/tag/v0.15.0)\n\n[Compare\nSource](https://redirect.github.com/jetpack-io/devbox-install-action/compare/0.15.0...0.15.0)\n\n#### What's Changed\n\n- Bump DeterminateSystems/nix-installer-action from 19 to 20 by\n[@&#8203;dependabot](https://redirect.github.com/dependabot)\\[bot] in\n[jetify-com#86](https://redirect.github.com/jetify-com/devbox-install-action/pull/86)\n- ci: Replace deprecated macos-13 runner with macos-15 by\n[@&#8203;Lagoja](https://redirect.github.com/Lagoja) in\n[jetify-com#91](https://redirect.github.com/jetify-com/devbox-install-action/pull/91)\n- Try moving to Nix Experimental installer by\n[@&#8203;Lagoja](https://redirect.github.com/Lagoja) in\n[jetify-com#85](https://redirect.github.com/jetify-com/devbox-install-action/pull/85)\n- Bump actions/cache from 4 to 5 by\n[@&#8203;dependabot](https://redirect.github.com/dependabot)\\[bot] in\n[jetify-com#89](https://redirect.github.com/jetify-com/devbox-install-action/pull/89)\n\n**Full Changelog**:\n<https://github.com/jetify-com/devbox-install-action/compare/v0.14.0...v0.15.0>\n\n###\n[`v0.15.0`](https://redirect.github.com/jetpack-io/devbox-install-action/compare/v0.14.0...0.15.0)\n\n[Compare\nSource](https://redirect.github.com/jetpack-io/devbox-install-action/compare/v0.14.0...0.15.0)\n\n</details>\n\n---\n\n### Configuration\n\n📅 **Schedule**: Branch creation - At 12:00 AM through 04:59 AM and 10:00\nPM through 11:59 PM, Monday through Friday ( * 0-4,22-23 * * 1-5 ), Only\non Sunday and Saturday ( * * * * 0,6 ) (UTC), Automerge - At any time\n(no schedule defined).\n\n🚦 **Automerge**: Enabled.\n\n♻ **Rebasing**: Whenever PR becomes conflicted, or you tick the\nrebase/retry checkbox.\n\n🔕 **Ignore**: Close this PR and you won't be reminded about this update\nagain.\n\n---\n\n- [ ] <!-- rebase-check -->If you want to rebase/retry this PR, check\nthis box\n\n---\n\nThis PR was generated by [Mend Renovate](https://mend.io/renovate/).\nView the [repository job\nlog](https://developer.mend.io/github/nobl9/govy).\n\n<!--renovate-debug:eyJjcmVhdGVkSW5WZXIiOiI0My42Ni40IiwidXBkYXRlZEluVmVyIjoiNDMuNjYuNCIsInRhcmdldEJyYW5jaCI6Im1haW4iLCJsYWJlbHMiOlsiZGVwZW5kZW5jaWVzIiwiZ2l0aHViLWFjdGlvbnMiLCJyZW5vdmF0ZSJdfQ==-->\n\nCo-authored-by: renovate[bot] <29139614+renovate[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>",
