          "id": "ff29feb8b6ef8089e902a1c16e29acb570a24cc3",
          "message": "chore: restore GITHUB_TOKEN env for release-drafter v7 (#210)\n\n## Summary\n- The release-drafter v7 upgrade removed the `GITHUB_TOKEN` env var in\nfavor of the `token` input\n- However, the `release-notes.bash` script uses `gh` CLI which requires\n`GITHUB_TOKEN` env var for authentication\n- This restores the env var on the `update_release_draft` job",
