          "message": "chore: Update release-drafter/release-drafter action to v7.5.1 (#246)\n\nThis PR contains the following updates:\n\n| Package | Type | Update | Change |\n|---|---|---|---|\n|\n[release-drafter/release-drafter](https://redirect.github.com/release-drafter/release-drafter)\n| action | minor | `v7.4.0` → `v7.5.1` |\n\n---\n\n### Release Notes\n\n<details>\n<summary>release-drafter/release-drafter\n(release-drafter/release-drafter)</summary>\n\n###\n[`v7.5.1`](https://redirect.github.com/release-drafter/release-drafter/compare/v7.5.0...v7.5.1)\n\n[Compare\nSource](https://redirect.github.com/release-drafter/release-drafter/compare/v7.5.0...v7.5.1)\n\n###\n[`v7.5.0`](https://redirect.github.com/release-drafter/release-drafter/releases/tag/v7.5.0)\n\n[Compare\nSource](https://redirect.github.com/release-drafter/release-drafter/compare/v7.4.0...v7.5.0)\n\n### What's Changed\n\n#### New\n\n- feat: align increments to semver lib from 0.0.0\n([#&#8203;1636](https://redirect.github.com/release-drafter/release-drafter/issues/1636))\n[@&#8203;cchanche](https://redirect.github.com/cchanche)\n\n#### Bug Fixes\n\n- fix: require actual matches for category mode `only`\n([#&#8203;1639](https://redirect.github.com/release-drafter/release-drafter/issues/1639))\n[@&#8203;cchanche](https://redirect.github.com/cchanche)\n\n#### Dependency Updates\n\n- build(deps): bump undici from 6.24.1 to 6.27.0\n([#&#8203;1637](https://redirect.github.com/release-drafter/release-drafter/issues/1637))\n@&#8203;[dependabot\\[bot\\]](https://redirect.github.com/apps/dependabot)\n\n**Full Changelog**:\n<https://github.com/release-drafter/release-drafter/compare/v7.4.0...v7.5.0>\n\n</details>\n\n---\n\n### Configuration\n\n📅 **Schedule**: (UTC)\n\n- Branch creation\n- At 12:00 AM through 04:59 AM and 10:00 PM through 11:59 PM, Monday\nthrough Friday (`* 0-4,22-23 * * 1-5`)\n  - Only on Sunday and Saturday (`* * * * 0,6`)\n- Automerge\n  - At any time (no schedule defined)\n\n🚦 **Automerge**: Enabled.\n\n♻ **Rebasing**: Whenever PR becomes conflicted, or you tick the\nrebase/retry checkbox.\n\n🔕 **Ignore**: Close this PR and you won't be reminded about this update\nagain.\n\n---\n\n- [ ] <!-- rebase-check -->If you want to rebase/retry this PR, check\nthis box\n\n---\n\nThis PR was generated by [Mend Renovate](https://mend.io/renovate/).\nView the [repository job\nlog](https://developer.mend.io/github/nobl9/govy).\n\n<!--renovate-debug:eyJjcmVhdGVkSW5WZXIiOiI0My4yNDIuMiIsInVwZGF0ZWRJblZlciI6IjQzLjI0Mi4yIiwidGFyZ2V0QnJhbmNoIjoibWFpbiIsImxhYmVscyI6WyJkZXBlbmRlbmNpZXMiLCJnaXRodWItYWN0aW9ucyIsInJlbm92YXRlIl19-->\n\nCo-authored-by: renovate[bot] <29139614+renovate[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>",
