          "distinct": true,
          "id": "cb4600cca72e58ae6e237205398b1fbc8463ca0f",
          "message": "feat: add E.164 phone string format rule (#264)\n\n## Motivation\n\n`pkg/rules` was missing a common E.164 phone string format validator\nthat users otherwise had to reimplement in application code.\n\n## Summary\n\nAdded an E.164 phone string format rule with an exported error code,\nmessage template, validation-plan description, and focused tests.\n\n## Testing\n\nAdded rule tests covering accepted examples, invalid messages, and\nerror-code assertions.\n\n## Release Notes\n\nAdded `rules.StringE164` for E.164 phone numbers.",
          "timestamp": "2026-07-20T17:36:11+02:00",
          "tree_id": "34d6198bf0683ca98852c7f0bd1b6696f879ee89",
