          "distinct": true,
          "id": "82ec76e0fb8d76255aaaec0d3e7659ee02f58b97",
          "message": "feat: add software identifier string format rules (#263)\n\n## Motivation\n\n`pkg/rules` was missing common software identifier string format\nvalidators that users otherwise had to reimplement in application code.\n\n## Summary\n\nAdded semantic-version and CVE string format rules with exported error\ncodes, message templates, validation-plan descriptions, and focused\ntests.\n\n## Testing\n\nAdded rule tests covering accepted examples, invalid messages, and\nerror-code assertions.\n\n## Release Notes\n\nAdded `rules.StringSemver` and `rules.StringCVE`.",
          "timestamp": "2026-07-20T18:25:11+02:00",
          "tree_id": "b08f211a2dedf04540046283f20230b75ebc4264",
