          "distinct": true,
          "id": "dcc7f58e2d87378677252cef663c13043c40b307",
          "message": "feat: add JWT string format rule (#262)\n\n## Motivation\n\n`pkg/rules` was missing a common JWT string format validator that users\notherwise had to reimplement in application code.\n\n## Summary\n\nAdded a JWT string format rule with an exported error code, message\ntemplate, validation-plan description, and focused tests. The\nimplementation lives next to `rules.StringJSON` because it validates\ncompact JSON token structure rather than a broader standalone rule\nfamily.\n\n## Testing\n\nAdded rule tests covering accepted examples, invalid messages, and\nerror-code assertions.\n\n## Release Notes\n\nAdded `rules.StringJWT`.",
          "timestamp": "2026-07-24T22:14:03+02:00",
          "tree_id": "51bf77b0256f818637df0e2c1e8ea1243a640822",
