          "distinct": true,
          "id": "a02e1b8af2092ab0285de7e37b30dac2f87ccd89",
          "message": "feat: add US tax ID string format rules (#261)\n\n## Motivation\n\n`pkg/rules` was missing common US tax identifier string format\nvalidators that users otherwise had to reimplement in application code.\n\n## Summary\n\nAdded EIN and SSN string format rules with exported error codes, message\ntemplates, validation-plan descriptions, and focused tests.\n\n## Testing\n\nAdded rule tests covering accepted examples, invalid messages, and\nerror-code assertions.\n\n## Release Notes\n\nAdded `rules.StringEIN` and `rules.StringSSN`.",
          "timestamp": "2026-07-24T22:31:40+02:00",
          "tree_id": "6c568d7ab98e18019adcce71a01fbff1f5973592",
