          "distinct": true,
          "id": "82707274247953805c5e6085a10f9cb8f62ae0fa",
          "message": "feat: add MongoDB ObjectID string rule (#258)\n\n## Motivation\n\n`pkg/rules` was missing a common MongoDB ObjectID string validator that\nusers otherwise had to reimplement in application code.\n\n## Summary\n\nAdded `rules.StringMongoDBObjectID` with an exported error code, message\ntemplate, validation-plan description, and focused tests. Kept the rule\ninline with the other simple string validators in `pkg/rules/string.go`.\n\n## Testing\n\nAdded rule tests covering accepted ObjectID values, invalid values,\nfailure messages, and error-code assertions.\n\n## Release Notes\n\nAdded `rules.StringMongoDBObjectID`.",
          "timestamp": "2026-07-24T22:36:19+02:00",
          "tree_id": "83d086fcac70a677a0840a425b58a8c340e52345",
