          "distinct": true,
          "id": "4bc4a295ac880ef7af2b5f73af1fabfa20f21dc8",
          "message": "feat: add hash digest string format rules (#259)\n\n## Motivation\n\n`pkg/rules` was missing common hash digest string format validators that\nusers otherwise had to reimplement in application code.\n\n## Summary\n\nAdded MD5, SHA-256, SHA-384, and SHA-512 string format rules with\nexported error codes, message templates, validation-plan descriptions,\nand focused tests.\n\n## Testing\n\nAdded rule tests covering accepted examples, invalid messages, and\nerror-code assertions.\n\n## Release Notes\n\nAdded `rules.StringMD5`, `rules.StringSHA256`, `rules.StringSHA384`, and\n`rules.StringSHA512`.",
          "timestamp": "2026-07-24T23:04:49+02:00",
          "tree_id": "7dc94c5bd6d22687cf84abe89e21d3d39b6b0855",
