          "distinct": true,
          "id": "d34fb3bb7409d2d66384f3a21fe719983086df62",
          "message": "feat: add identifier string format rules (#253)\n\n## Motivation\n\n`pkg/rules` was missing common identifier string format validators that\nusers otherwise had to reimplement in application code.\n\n## Summary\n\nAdded UUID variant and ULID string format rules with exported error\ncodes, message templates, validation-plan descriptions, and focused\ntests. Moved the existing `rules.StringUUID` implementation next to the\nrelated UUID/ULID rules so related string format validators are kept\ntogether.\n\n## Testing\n\nAdded rule tests covering accepted examples, invalid messages, and\nerror-code assertions.\n\n## Release Notes\n\nAdded `rules.StringUUIDRFC4122`, `rules.StringUUIDv3`,\n`rules.StringUUIDv4`, `rules.StringUUIDv5`, and `rules.StringULID`.",
          "timestamp": "2026-07-24T23:26:05+02:00",
          "tree_id": "c73f74f9fbf30f3fd30f71371981ca17d5136d83",
          "url": "https://github.com/nobl9/govy/commit/d34fb3bb7409d2d66384f3a21fe719983086df62"
