          "distinct": true,
          "id": "2a5219d4e9f0a994f4bf25960b5e0d8657a98388",
          "message": "feat: add payment and banking string format rules (#260)\n\n## Motivation\n\n`pkg/rules` was missing common payment and banking string format\nvalidators that users otherwise had to reimplement in application code.\n\n## Summary\n\nAdded credit-card, Luhn checksum, and BIC string format rules with\nexported error codes, message templates, validation-plan descriptions,\nand focused tests.\n\n## Testing\n\nAdded rule tests covering accepted examples, invalid messages, and\nerror-code assertions.\n\n## Release Notes\n\nAdded `rules.StringCreditCard`, `rules.StringLuhnChecksum`,\n`rules.StringBIC`, and `rules.StringBICISO93622014`.",
          "timestamp": "2026-07-25T13:28:40+02:00",
