          "id": "84c2a62a1fa36e32e3f4a5747cd2e89c5004e4f4",
          "message": "feat: add encoding string format rules (#252)\n\n## Motivation\n\n`pkg/rules` was missing common encoding string format validators that\nusers otherwise had to reimplement in application code.\n\n## Summary\n\nAdded encoding string format rules with exported error codes, message\ntemplates, validation-plan descriptions, and focused tests.\n\n## Testing\n\nAdded rule tests covering accepted examples, invalid messages, and\nerror-code assertions.\n\n## Release Notes\n\nAdded `rules.StringBase64`, `rules.StringBase64URL`,\n`rules.StringBase64RawURL`, and `rules.StringHexadecimal`.",
          "timestamp": "2026-07-25T16:28:45+02:00",
          "tree_id": "04e84d390589173fa7bf5c5c55d2bcee64cc6647",
