          "distinct": true,
          "id": "45df6ac4a5baea8a2429f8742ff9a1519d55c706",
          "message": "feat: add publication string format rules (#255)\n\n## Motivation\n\n`pkg/rules` was missing common publication identifier string format\nvalidators that users otherwise had to reimplement in application code.\n\n## Summary\n\nAdded ISBN and ISSN string format rules with exported error codes,\nmessage templates, validation-plan descriptions, and focused tests.\n\n## Testing\n\nAdded rule tests covering accepted examples, invalid messages, and\nerror-code assertions.\n\n## Release Notes\n\nAdded `rules.StringISBN`, `rules.StringISBN10`, `rules.StringISBN13`,\nand `rules.StringISSN`.",
          "timestamp": "2026-07-27T10:30:37+02:00",
          "tree_id": "adf82beb55b3c223cba0695cd2a5065ccc458d57",
