          "message": "fix: avoid hiding blank values in rule errors (#275)\n\n## Motivation\n\nCloses https://github.com/nobl9/govy/issues/273.\n\n## Release Notes\n\nWhen `govy.PropertyRules.HideValue()` is used on an empty string\n(including only whitespace), the string will NOT be hidden anymore.",
