          "distinct": true,
          "id": "108f95455f74f245ba6641694e0a5485378c3caf",
          "message": "chore: Update minor and patch Golang dependencies (#277)\n\nThis PR contains the following updates:\n\n| Package | Change |\n[Age](https://docs.renovatebot.com/merge-confidence/) |\n[Adoption](https://docs.renovatebot.com/merge-confidence/) |\n[Passing](https://docs.renovatebot.com/merge-confidence/) |\n[Confidence](https://docs.renovatebot.com/merge-confidence/) |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| [github.com/nobl9/govy](https://redirect.github.com/nobl9/govy) |\n`v0.27.0` → `v0.28.0` |\n![age](https://developer.mend.io/api/mc/badges/age/go/github.com%2fnobl9%2fgovy/v0.28.0?slim=true)\n|\n![adoption](https://developer.mend.io/api/mc/badges/adoption/go/github.com%2fnobl9%2fgovy/v0.28.0?slim=true)\n|\n![passing](https://developer.mend.io/api/mc/badges/compatibility/go/github.com%2fnobl9%2fgovy/v0.27.0/v0.28.0?slim=true)\n|\n![confidence](https://developer.mend.io/api/mc/badges/confidence/go/github.com%2fnobl9%2fgovy/v0.27.0/v0.28.0?slim=true)\n|\n| golang.org/x/text | `v0.38.0` → `v0.40.0` |\n![age](https://developer.mend.io/api/mc/badges/age/go/golang.org%2fx%2ftext/v0.40.0?slim=true)\n|\n![adoption](https://developer.mend.io/api/mc/badges/adoption/go/golang.org%2fx%2ftext/v0.40.0?slim=true)\n|\n![passing](https://developer.mend.io/api/mc/badges/compatibility/go/golang.org%2fx%2ftext/v0.38.0/v0.40.0?slim=true)\n|\n![confidence](https://developer.mend.io/api/mc/badges/confidence/go/golang.org%2fx%2ftext/v0.38.0/v0.40.0?slim=true)\n|\n\n---\n\n### Release Notes\n\n<details>\n<summary>nobl9/govy (github.com/nobl9/govy)</summary>\n\n###\n[`v0.28.0`](https://redirect.github.com/nobl9/govy/releases/tag/v0.28.0)\n\n[Compare\nSource](https://redirect.github.com/nobl9/govy/compare/v0.27.0...v0.28.0)\n\n### What's Changed\n\n#### 🚀 Features\n\n- feat: add locale and geo string format rules\n([#&#8203;256](https://redirect.github.com/nobl9/govy/issues/256))\n[@&#8203;nieomylnieja](https://redirect.github.com/nieomylnieja)\n> Added `rules.StringBCP47LanguageTag`,\n`rules.StringBCP47StrictLanguageTag`, `rules.StringISO3166Alpha2`,\n`rules.StringISO3166Alpha3`, `rules.StringISO3166Numeric`,\n`rules.StringISO31662`, `rules.StringISO4217`, `rules.StringLatitude`,\nand `rules.StringLongitude`.\n- feat: add publication string format rules\n([#&#8203;255](https://redirect.github.com/nobl9/govy/issues/255))\n[@&#8203;nieomylnieja](https://redirect.github.com/nieomylnieja)\n> Added `rules.StringISBN`, `rules.StringISBN10`, `rules.StringISBN13`,\nand `rules.StringISSN`.\n- feat: add encoding string format rules\n([#&#8203;252](https://redirect.github.com/nobl9/govy/issues/252))\n[@&#8203;nieomylnieja](https://redirect.github.com/nieomylnieja)\n> Added `rules.StringBase64`, `rules.StringBase64URL`,\n`rules.StringBase64RawURL`, and `rules.StringHexadecimal`.\n- feat: add payment and banking string format rules\n([#&#8203;260](https://redirect.github.com/nobl9/govy/issues/260))\n[@&#8203;nieomylnieja](https://redirect.github.com/nieomylnieja)\n> Added `rules.StringCreditCard`, `rules.StringLuhnChecksum`,\n`rules.StringBIC`, and `rules.StringBICISO93622014`.\n\n#### 🐞 Bug Fixes\n\n- fix: avoid hiding blank values in rule errors\n([#&#8203;275](https://redirect.github.com/nobl9/govy/issues/275))\n[@&#8203;nieomylnieja](https://redirect.github.com/nieomylnieja)\n> When `govy.PropertyRules.HideValue()` is used on an empty string\n(including only whitespace), the string will NOT be hidden anymore.\n\n#### 🧰 Maintenance\n\n- chore: Update dependency go to v1.26.5\n([#&#8203;274](https://redirect.github.com/nobl9/govy/issues/274))\n@&#8203;[renovate\\[bot\\]](https://redirect.github.com/apps/renovate)\n- chore: Update module github.com/nobl9/govy to v0.27.0\n([#&#8203;272](https://redirect.github.com/nobl9/govy/issues/272))\n@&#8203;[renovate\\[bot\\]](https://redirect.github.com/apps/renovate)\n\n</details>\n\n---\n\n### Configuration\n\n📅 **Schedule**: (UTC)\n\n- Branch creation\n- At 12:00 AM through 04:59 AM and 10:00 PM through 11:59 PM, Monday\nthrough Friday (`* 0-4,22-23 * * 1-5`)\n  - Only on Sunday and Saturday (`* * * * 0,6`)\n- Automerge\n  - At any time (no schedule defined)\n\n🚦 **Automerge**: Enabled.\n\n♻ **Rebasing**: Whenever PR becomes conflicted, or you tick the\nrebase/retry checkbox.\n\n👻 **Immortal**: This PR will be recreated if closed unmerged. Get\n[config\nhelp](https://redirect.github.com/renovatebot/renovate/discussions) if\nthat's undesired.\n\n---\n\n- [ ] <!-- rebase-check -->If you want to rebase/retry this PR, check\nthis box\n\n---\n\nThis PR was generated by [Mend Renovate](https://mend.io/renovate/).\nView the [repository job\nlog](https://developer.mend.io/github/nobl9/govy).\n\n<!--renovate-debug:eyJjcmVhdGVkSW5WZXIiOiI0My4yODAuMCIsInVwZGF0ZWRJblZlciI6IjQzLjI4MC4wIiwidGFyZ2V0QnJhbmNoIjoibWFpbiIsImxhYmVscyI6WyJkZXBlbmRlbmNpZXMiLCJnb2xhbmciLCJyZW5vdmF0ZSJdfQ==-->\n\nCo-authored-by: renovate[bot] <29139614+renovate[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>",
