          "message": "chore: Update release-drafter/release-drafter action to v7.7.0 (#279)\n\nThis PR contains the following updates:\n\n| Package | Type | Update | Change |\n|---|---|---|---|\n|\n[release-drafter/release-drafter](https://redirect.github.com/release-drafter/release-drafter)\n| action | minor | `v7.6.0` → `v7.7.0` |\n\n---\n\n### Release Notes\n\n<details>\n<summary>release-drafter/release-drafter\n(release-drafter/release-drafter)</summary>\n\n###\n[`v7.7.0`](https://redirect.github.com/release-drafter/release-drafter/releases/tag/v7.7.0)\n\n[Compare\nSource](https://redirect.github.com/release-drafter/release-drafter/compare/v7.6.0...v7.7.0)\n\n### What's Changed\n\n#### New\n\n- feat: no new contributor template\n([#&#8203;1687](https://redirect.github.com/release-drafter/release-drafter/issues/1687))\n[@&#8203;cchanche](https://redirect.github.com/cchanche)\n- feat: categorize PRs based on conventional title\n([#&#8203;1556](https://redirect.github.com/release-drafter/release-drafter/issues/1556))\n[@&#8203;cchanche](https://redirect.github.com/cchanche)\n- feat: log all config sources\n([#&#8203;1674](https://redirect.github.com/release-drafter/release-drafter/issues/1674))\n[@&#8203;jetersen](https://redirect.github.com/jetersen)\n\n#### Dependency Updates\n\n<details>\n<summary>9 changes</summary>\n\n- build(deps-dev): bump postcss from 8.5.17 to 8.5.23\n([#&#8203;1683](https://redirect.github.com/release-drafter/release-drafter/issues/1683))\n[@&#8203;dependabot\\[bot\\]](https://redirect.github.com/apps/dependabot)\n- chore(deps): update npm tool constraint to 12.0.1\n([#&#8203;1668](https://redirect.github.com/release-drafter/release-drafter/issues/1668))\n[@&#8203;renovate\\[bot\\]](https://redirect.github.com/apps/renovate),\n[@&#8203;cchanche](https://redirect.github.com/cchanche)\n- chore(deps): update npm tool constraint to 11.18.0\n([#&#8203;1665](https://redirect.github.com/release-drafter/release-drafter/issues/1665))\n[@&#8203;renovate\\[bot\\]](https://redirect.github.com/apps/renovate),\n[@&#8203;cchanche](https://redirect.github.com/cchanche)\n- chore(deps): update node.js to v24.18.0\n([#&#8203;1664](https://redirect.github.com/release-drafter/release-drafter/issues/1664))\n[@&#8203;renovate\\[bot\\]](https://redirect.github.com/apps/renovate)\n- build(deps): support GraphQL 17\n([#&#8203;1678](https://redirect.github.com/release-drafter/release-drafter/issues/1678))\n[@&#8203;jetersen](https://redirect.github.com/jetersen)\n- build(deps-dev): Update js-yaml to 4.3.0\n([#&#8203;1677](https://redirect.github.com/release-drafter/release-drafter/issues/1677))\n[@&#8203;jetersen](https://redirect.github.com/jetersen)\n- build(deps-dev): bump shell-quote from 1.8.4 to 1.10.0\n([#&#8203;1676](https://redirect.github.com/release-drafter/release-drafter/issues/1676))\n[@&#8203;dependabot\\[bot\\]](https://redirect.github.com/apps/dependabot)\n- build(deps): bump immutable from 5.1.5 to 5.1.9\n([#&#8203;1675](https://redirect.github.com/release-drafter/release-drafter/issues/1675))\n[@&#8203;dependabot\\[bot\\]](https://redirect.github.com/apps/dependabot)\n- build(deps-dev): bump brace-expansion from 5.0.6 to 5.0.7\n([#&#8203;1672](https://redirect.github.com/release-drafter/release-drafter/issues/1672))\n[@&#8203;dependabot\\[bot\\]](https://redirect.github.com/apps/dependabot)\n\n</details>\n\n#### Bug Fixes\n\n- fix: preserve proxy-aware fetch in octokit client\n([#&#8203;1682](https://redirect.github.com/release-drafter/release-drafter/issues/1682))\n[@&#8203;jetersen](https://redirect.github.com/jetersen)\n\n#### Maintenance\n\n- chore: update references to branch master to main\n([#&#8203;1686](https://redirect.github.com/release-drafter/release-drafter/issues/1686))\n[@&#8203;cchanche](https://redirect.github.com/cchanche)\n- ci: rely on conventional pr titles\n([#&#8203;1685](https://redirect.github.com/release-drafter/release-drafter/issues/1685))\n[@&#8203;cchanche](https://redirect.github.com/cchanche)\n\n#### New Contributors\n\n- No new contributors\n\n**Full Changelog**:\n<https://github.com/release-drafter/release-drafter/compare/v7.6.0...v7.7.0>\n\n</details>\n\n---\n\n### Configuration\n\n📅 **Schedule**: (UTC)\n\n- Branch creation\n- At 12:00 AM through 04:59 AM and 10:00 PM through 11:59 PM, Monday\nthrough Friday (`* 0-4,22-23 * * 1-5`)\n  - Only on Sunday and Saturday (`* * * * 0,6`)\n- Automerge\n  - At any time (no schedule defined)\n\n🚦 **Automerge**: Enabled.\n\n♻ **Rebasing**: Whenever PR becomes conflicted, or you tick the\nrebase/retry checkbox.\n\n🔕 **Ignore**: Close this PR and you won't be reminded about this update\nagain.\n\n---\n\n- [ ] <!-- rebase-check -->If you want to rebase/retry this PR, check\nthis box\n\n---\n\nThis PR was generated by [Mend Renovate](https://mend.io/renovate/).\nView the [repository job\nlog](https://developer.mend.io/github/nobl9/govy).\n\n<!--renovate-debug:eyJjcmVhdGVkSW5WZXIiOiI0My4yODAuMCIsInVwZGF0ZWRJblZlciI6IjQzLjI4MC4wIiwidGFyZ2V0QnJhbmNoIjoibWFpbiIsImxhYmVscyI6WyJkZXBlbmRlbmNpZXMiLCJnaXRodWItYWN0aW9ucyIsInJlbm92YXRlIl19-->\n\nCo-authored-by: renovate[bot] <29139614+renovate[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>",
