          "id": "21924535ecda5f077ddc58dc8b43426b6a9319d6",
          "message": "feat: include validator type information in plans (#286)\n\n## Motivation\n\nValidator type information is currently missing from validation plans.\n\n## Summary\n\nAdded validator type information to generated plans and their JSON\noutput. Updated the affected fixtures and testable examples.\n\n## Testing\n\nUpdated plan fixtures and testable examples to cover validator type\ninformation for named structs and built-in types.\n\n## Release Notes\n\nValidation plans now include the validator's type information.",
