          "distinct": true,
          "id": "5ad6a9022d11b55ab76dc108abab21a27edb49a9",
          "message": "chore: Update module github.com/nobl9/govy to v0.29.0 (#287)\n\nThis PR contains the following updates:\n\n| Package | Change |\n[Age](https://docs.renovatebot.com/merge-confidence/) |\n[Adoption](https://docs.renovatebot.com/merge-confidence/) |\n[Passing](https://docs.renovatebot.com/merge-confidence/) |\n[Confidence](https://docs.renovatebot.com/merge-confidence/) |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| [github.com/nobl9/govy](https://redirect.github.com/nobl9/govy) |\n`v0.28.0` → `v0.29.0` |\n![age](https://developer.mend.io/api/mc/badges/age/go/github.com%2fnobl9%2fgovy/v0.29.0?slim=true)\n|\n![adoption](https://developer.mend.io/api/mc/badges/adoption/go/github.com%2fnobl9%2fgovy/v0.29.0?slim=true)\n|\n![passing](https://developer.mend.io/api/mc/badges/compatibility/go/github.com%2fnobl9%2fgovy/v0.28.0/v0.29.0?slim=true)\n|\n![confidence](https://developer.mend.io/api/mc/badges/confidence/go/github.com%2fnobl9%2fgovy/v0.28.0/v0.29.0?slim=true)\n|\n\n---\n\n### Release Notes\n\n<details>\n<summary>nobl9/govy (github.com/nobl9/govy)</summary>\n\n###\n[`v0.29.0`](https://redirect.github.com/nobl9/govy/releases/tag/v0.29.0)\n\n[Compare\nSource](https://redirect.github.com/nobl9/govy/compare/v0.28.0...v0.29.0)\n\n### What's Changed\n\n#### ⚠️  Breaking Changes\n\n- feat: add validation options for hiding sensitive values\n([#&#8203;284](https://redirect.github.com/nobl9/govy/issues/284))\n[@&#8203;nieomylnieja](https://redirect.github.com/nieomylnieja)\n> - Removed `PropertyErrors.HideValue`, `(*PropertyError).HideValue`,\nand `(*RuleError).HideValue`. Callers must configure redaction with\n`PropertyRules.HideValue` before validation.\n> - Changed public `Validate` method signatures on validators, rules,\nrule sets, and property-rule types to accept `...ValidationOption`.\nExisting direct calls remain valid, but method values and matching\ninterfaces must use the new signature.\n\n#### 🚀 Features\n\n- feat: add validation options for hiding sensitive values\n([#&#8203;284](https://redirect.github.com/nobl9/govy/issues/284))\n[@&#8203;nieomylnieja](https://redirect.github.com/nieomylnieja)\n> `PropertyRules.HideValue` now propagates through nested validators,\ntransforms, maps, and slices, and redacts both full and truncated value\nforms. For message templates, it redacts `TemplateVars.PropertyValue`\nand `TemplateVars.Error` before execution and leaves all other variables\nunder template-author control.\n\n#### 🐞 Bug Fixes\n\n- fix: preserve conditions across validation plan branches\n([#&#8203;285](https://redirect.github.com/nobl9/govy/issues/285))\n[@&#8203;nieomylnieja](https://redirect.github.com/nieomylnieja)\n\n#### 🧰 Maintenance\n\n<details>\n<summary>6 changes</summary>\n\n- chore: Update module golang.org/x/tools to v0.49.0 - abandoned\n([#&#8203;283](https://redirect.github.com/nobl9/govy/issues/283))\n@&#8203;[renovate\\[bot\\]](https://redirect.github.com/apps/renovate)\n- chore: clarify cascade mode inheritance and inclusion behavior\n([#&#8203;281](https://redirect.github.com/nobl9/govy/issues/281))\n[@&#8203;nieomylnieja](https://redirect.github.com/nieomylnieja)\n- chore: Update module golang.org/x/text to v0.41.0\n([#&#8203;282](https://redirect.github.com/nobl9/govy/issues/282))\n@&#8203;[renovate\\[bot\\]](https://redirect.github.com/apps/renovate)\n- chore: Update release-drafter/release-drafter action to v7.7.0\n([#&#8203;279](https://redirect.github.com/nobl9/govy/issues/279))\n@&#8203;[renovate\\[bot\\]](https://redirect.github.com/apps/renovate)\n- chore: remove Go Report Card badge\n([#&#8203;276](https://redirect.github.com/nobl9/govy/issues/276))\n[@&#8203;nieomylnieja](https://redirect.github.com/nieomylnieja)\n- chore: Update minor and patch Golang dependencies\n([#&#8203;277](https://redirect.github.com/nobl9/govy/issues/277))\n@&#8203;[renovate\\[bot\\]](https://redirect.github.com/apps/renovate)\n\n</details>\n\n</details>\n\n---\n\n### Configuration\n\n📅 **Schedule**: (UTC)\n\n- Branch creation\n- At 12:00 AM through 04:59 AM and 10:00 PM through 11:59 PM, Monday\nthrough Friday (`* 0-4,22-23 * * 1-5`)\n  - Only on Sunday and Saturday (`* * * * 0,6`)\n- Automerge\n  - At any time (no schedule defined)\n\n🚦 **Automerge**: Enabled.\n\n♻ **Rebasing**: Whenever PR becomes conflicted, or you tick the\nrebase/retry checkbox.\n\n🔕 **Ignore**: Close this PR and you won't be reminded about this update\nagain.\n\n---\n\n- [ ] <!-- rebase-check -->If you want to rebase/retry this PR, check\nthis box\n\n---\n\nThis PR was generated by [Mend Renovate](https://mend.io/renovate/).\nView the [repository job\nlog](https://developer.mend.io/github/nobl9/govy).\n\n<!--renovate-debug:eyJjcmVhdGVkSW5WZXIiOiI0NC4yOS41IiwidXBkYXRlZEluVmVyIjoiNDQuMjkuNSIsInRhcmdldEJyYW5jaCI6Im1haW4iLCJsYWJlbHMiOlsiZGVwZW5kZW5jaWVzIiwiZ29sYW5nIiwicmVub3ZhdGUiXX0=-->\n\nCo-authored-by: renovate[bot] <29139614+renovate[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>",
